join detective right
detective: How well do you know the cook?
join gardener left
gardener: The cook?
gardener (antsy): Well, um, she can be a real scary lady at times.
gardener (speaking): I mean I bet she must be fed up with a job like that.
gardener: Imagine dedicating years honing your cooking skills, only to be cooped up making blood gelatin all day long.
gardener: Don't think anyone would be too fond of Drac in her shoes.
gardener: Especially considering how she always says "vampires" with venom in her voice. Not sure she likes 'em too much.
